sequenceDiagram
    participant Main as ProximaDB Main
    participant Config as Configuration
    participant Core as Core Services
    participant Storage as Storage Layer
    participant Network as Network Layer
    participant Recovery as Recovery Manager
    
    Note over Main: System Startup Sequence
    
    Main->>Config: Load configuration files
    Config-->>Main: Configuration loaded
    
    Main->>Core: Initialize core services
    Core->>Core: Start metrics collector
    Core->>Core: Initialize shared services
    Core->>Core: Setup hardware capabilities
    Core-->>Main: Core services ready
    
    Main->>Storage: Setup storage engines
    Storage->>Storage: Initialize SST engine
    Storage->>Storage: Initialize VIPER engine
    Storage->>Storage: Configure compression
    Storage-->>Main: Storage engines ready
    
    Main->>Network: Start network services
    Network->>Network: Launch REST API server
    Network->>Network: Launch gRPC server
    Network->>Network: Register unified handlers
    Network-->>Main: Network services ready
    
    Main->>Recovery: Recover existing data
    Recovery->>Recovery: Restore collections
    Recovery->>Recovery: Replay WAL entries
    Recovery->>Recovery: Rebuild indexes
    Recovery-->>Main: Recovery complete
    
    Note over Main: System Ready to Serve Requests